WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.190
Costa Rica tops the Happy Planet
Index: first of 134 countries in 2025.

2
00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:12.550
Its GDP per person is 26,973 dollars.

3
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:18.290
The United States: 75,489
dollars per person.

4
00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:20.250
Yet it ranks far lower.

5
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:23.110
Is development just about getting richer?

6
00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:25.790
So what should development mean?

7
00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:28.270
In this mission, you'll
compare GDP growth,

8
00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:33.270
the traditional measure, with an index
that ranks countries on wellbeing.

9
00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:36.610
Then you'll weigh growth as a
goal against growth as a means,

10
00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:42.010
and see why 64 million primary-age
children miss out on school.

11
00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.400
Your mission: decide what
development should mean.
